    "body": "**Describe the bug**\r\nThere are internal/sensitive documents and links that are accessible through the delegate/senior delegate panel on staging.\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n1. Log into accounts with a board member/senior delegate.\r\n2. Click on the delegate panel\r\n3. Click on any link to a google doc external to a WCA site\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nNot allowing people to see this stuff.\r\n\r\n**Screenshots**\r\nAny link below to a google doc is viewable by anyone who logs into my account on staging, as an example. This allows anyone to access forms for promoting delegates, or see internal documentation like the probationary policy.\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/6166412/51817635-60668300-2280-11e9-8180-2723c8d8194e.png)\r\n\r\nThanks to Sam Baird for pointing this out to me!\r\n",
